			description: [
				"This versatile artifact functions as a shield without any durability and gently slows your descent when held, offering both protection and mobility in a single tool."
				""
				"You can discover the Umbrella within buried treasure chests, desert pyramids, and village tanneries. It may also be uncovered through archaeology in desert wells, rewarding those who explore the sands with patience and curiosity."
			]
