		{
			dependencies: ["3CE72BF099174999"]
			description: [
				"A unique food item that never gets consumed when eaten, instead operating on a short 15-second cooldown. The Everlasting Beef provides reliable nourishment during long expeditions without needing to restock supplies."
				""
				"This rare artifact can drop from cows slain by players, with a 1 in 500 chance that is not influenced by Looting. It may also appear occasionally within bastion stables or village butcher chests, rewarding those who search diligently for its enduring value."
			]
